        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LRM150SBR, 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Retro Wooden Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Laramie Door Pull can be made in your choice of different types of wood; and the retro styled mounting brackets can be finished in a huge selection of colors. This 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Retro Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Retro Door Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LRM01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262339\"><b>First Impressions LRM150SBR Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LRM150018SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LRM150024SBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LRM150036SBR:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
