                "description": "The Laramie Door Pull can be made in your choice of different types of wood; and the retro styled mounting brackets can be finished in a huge selection of colors. This 1-1/2 Inch Diameter Retro Door Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. \r\n",
